<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 3.60 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 3.60 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 3.60 percent on Sunday from 4.36 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said three banks traded in five reported transactions worth 5.9 million dinars ($8 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
